{
  "slug": "cto-toolkit",
  "name": "Cto Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete CTO & Staff Engineer toolkit: 24 skills covering code review, architecture, DevOps, security, testing, and engineering management",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Agents** (6): `adversarial-reviewer` (Adversarial architecture reviewer agent), `architecture-reviewer` (Autonomous architecture health analyzer), `onboarding-guide` (Autonomous project onboarding agent), `release-readiness` (Autonomous release readiness assessor), `security-auditor` (Autonomous security audit agent), `tech-debt-analyzer` (Autonomous technical debt analyzer)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cto-toolkit@claude-community` from `camilooscargbaptista/cto-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 6,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
